# armour/<body>/skirt_hauberk_back: the hauberk's lower courses and hem behind the legs (layer back).
# Generated from the FORGE-LIMBS skirt templates (gen_skirts2.py, skirts_def.py; iteration 2: the D view serves U, `tags anyfacing`); Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body woman
role overlay skirt.hauberk
layer back
anchor hip
keys hang
tags anyfacing
z 10

view D key rest origin 0 0
|.

view D key rest origin 8 -5 when !form-mail replace
|vwwwwwwwwwwwwwwv
|vvvvvvvvvvvvvvvv
regions
|.RRRRRRRRRRRRRR.
|................

view D key flare origin 0 0
|.

view D key flare origin 9 -5 when !form-mail replace
|vwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwv
|vvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvvv
regions
|.RRRRRRRRRRRRRRRR.
|..................

